            <div xml:id="d468-a1">

                <pb facs="0578" n="470" xml:id="pg470"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">General Ruggles to
                            Commanding General Department of
                    Texas.</hi></head>
                <p>Telegraphic advices from Mexican consul at El Paso report an armed and mounted
                    force of 25 men at San Elizario, Tex., preparing to invade Mexican territory.
                    Use the force at your command to prevent this invasion. If these men are armed
                    with the manifest intention of invading Mexico, apxrehend the party, disarm it,
                    and report by telegram. Acknowledge receipt.</p>
                <p>By command of Major-General Schofleld.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ruggles</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Adjutant General.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
